/Title (Most new homeowners have no trusted contractor. Handyman and plumbing firms each run their own website or rely on word of mouth, so no single place lets owners compare them. Bookings happen over WhatsApp or phone, so an owner must contact firms one by one to find a free slot and a price, while slots in a busy estate fill up fast. Prices are not published in a standard way, and reviews on company websites can be filtered or inflated.)
